# Context Snack

Cursor extension: micro-learning feed while the agent is busy. Feed-first; games never auto-open.

## Layout

- `src/extension.ts` - activate, commands, status bar, watcher wiring
- `src/agent/` - hooks install, busy watcher, mute store
- `src/feed/` - fetch, quality, cache, order, webview
- `src/feed/sources/` - one module per source + `registry.ts`
- `src/games/` - optional retro games
- `src/mood/` - optional reactions (needs `assets/reactions/`)

## Constraints

- Never wipe `~/.cursor/hooks.json` on parse failure
- Auto-show only when a project is open and workspace roots match
- Card quality: reject empty / fake / URL-only summaries
- After feed/UI changes: follow `ui-verify.mdc` (compile + judge + preview + read screenshot)
- Product decisions: `CONTEXT.md`
